INSERT INTO agent_messages VALUES(53,'26cb378e-4e35-4a04-9330-df54886868ec','{"call_id": "call_V23u3BgPGGCLAusH6tN7OOZB", "output": "{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"sections\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"document_id\\\": \\\"20ea133f1a278acf28b4d904d73e9f79\\\",\\n      \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Definitions\\\",\\n      \\\"text\\\": \\\"[ORG=cpso] [TYPE=policy] [TOPIC=] **Virtual Care:** Any interaction between patients and/or members of their circle of care1 that occurs remotely2, using any form of communication or information technology, including telephone, video conferencing, and digital messaging (e.g., secure messaging, emails, and text messaging) with the aim of facilitating or providing patient care.3\\\",\\n      \\\"chunk_type\\\": \\\"child\\\",\\n      \\\"relevance_score\\\": 0.8,\\n      \\\"metadata\\\": {}\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"document_id\\\": \\\"04ffded4c0aab9414681ee57aee7e29023a5799be33c8c987a9b98c762a3c3a3_full\\\",\\n      \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Advice to the Profession: Virtual Care\\\",\\n      \\\"text\\\": \\\"[ORG=cpso] [TYPE=advice] [TOPIC=] # Advice to the Profession: Virtual Care\\\\n\\\\n[](#)\\\\n\\\\n**Last Updated: **June 2022\\\\n\\\\n\u00a0\\\\n\\\\n*Advice to the Profession* companion documents are intended to provide physicians with additional information and general advice in order to support their understanding and implementation of the expectations set out in policies. They may also identify some additional best practices regarding specific practice issues.\\\\n\\\\n \\\\n\\\\nVirtual care plays an important role in the health-care system\\\",\\n      \\\"chunk_type\\\": \\\"parent\\\",\\n      \\\"relevance_score\\\": 0.8,\\n      \\\"metadata\\\": {}\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"document_id\\\": \\\"06bc2c515c4a3fa447e63beb93347587\\\",\\n      \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Virtual Care is the Practice of Medicine\\\",\\n      \\\"text\\\": \\\"[ORG=cpso] [TYPE=advice] [TOPIC=] ***Can you elaborate on the scope of the policy? What medical services are captured by the term \u201cvirtual care\u201d?\u00a0***\\\\n\\\\nVirtual care is defined in the policy as \u201cany interaction between patients and/or members of their circle of care that occurs remotely, using any form of communication or information technology, including telephone, video conferencing, and digital messaging (e.g., secure messaging, emails, and text messaging), with the aim of facilitating or provi\\\",\\n      \\\"chunk_type\\\": \\\"child\\\",\\n      \\\"relevance_score\\\": 0.8,\\n      \\\"metadata\\\": {}\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"document_id\\\": \\\"b348bd9139cc5e50f7c3d94a4ddf7eee6b061486710750764d900186746c0385_full\\\",\\n      \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Virtual Care\\\",\\n      \\\"text\\\": \\\"[ORG=cpso] [TYPE=policy] [TOPIC=] # Virtual Care\\\\n\\\\n[](#)\\\\n\\\\n**Approved by Council:** April 2007\\\\n**Reviewed and Updated:** December 2014, May 2019, June 2022\\\\n\\\\n**Companion Resources:\u00a0**\\\\n\\\\n- [Advice to the Profession](/en/Physicians/Policies-Guidance/Policies/Virtual-Care/Advice-to-the-Profession-Virtual-Care)\\\\n- [What to Expect When Receiving Virtual Care from Ontario Doctors\u00a0](/en/Physicians/Policies-Guidance/Policies/Virtual-Care/What-to-Expect-When-Receiving-Care-from-Ontario-Do) \u00a0[PDF](/getmedia/e8\\\",\\n      \\\"chunk_type\\\": \\\"parent\\\",\\n      \\\"relevance_score\\\": 0.8,\\n      \\\"metadata\\\": {}\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"document_id\\\": \\\"40b976e09bb0def900a2ceac2a8d6592\\\",\\n      \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Privacy, Security, and Informed Consent\\\",\\n      \\\"text\\\": \\\"[ORG=cpso] [TYPE=advice] [TOPIC=] ***Where can I find more information about how to comply with privacy and security obligations in a virtual environment*****?**\\\\n\\\\nThe Information and Privacy Commissioner of Ontario has released comprehensive guidelines regarding [*Privacy and security considerations for virtual health care visits*](https://www.ipc.on.ca/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/virtual-health-care-visits.pdf) to assist health care providers in complying with their privacy and security obligati\\\",\\n      \\\"chunk_type\\\": \\\"child\\\",\\n      \\\"relevance_score\\\": 0.8,\\n      \\\"metadata\\\": {}\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"documents\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"document_id\\\": \\\"20ea133f1a278acf28b4d904d73e9f79\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Virtual Care\\\",\\n      \\\"source_org\\\": \\\"cpso\\\",\\n      \\\"document_type\\\": \\\"policy\\\",\\n      \\\"effective_date\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"topics\\\": [],\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.cpso.on.ca/en/Physicians/Policies-Guidance/Policies/Virtual-Care\\\",\\n      \\\"is_superseded\\\": false\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"document_id\\\": \\\"04ffded4c0aab9414681ee57aee7e29023a5799be33c8c987a9b98c762a3c3a3_full\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Advice to the Profession: Virtual Care\\\",\\n      \\\"source_org\\\": \\\"cpso\\\",\\n      \\\"document_type\\\": \\\"advice\\\",\\n      \\\"effective_date\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"topics\\\": [],\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.cpso.on.ca/en/Physicians/Policies-Guidance/Policies/Virtual-Care/Advice-to-the-Profession-Virtual-Care\\\",\\n      \\\"is_superseded\\\": false\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"document_id\\\": \\\"06bc2c515c4a3fa447e63beb93347587\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Advice to the Profession: Virtual Care\\\",\\n      \\\"source_org\\\": \\\"cpso\\\",\\n      \\\"document_type\\\": \\\"advice\\\",\\n      \\\"effective_date\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"topics\\\": [],\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.cpso.on.ca/en/Physicians/Policies-Guidance/Policies/Virtual-Care/Advice-to-the-Profession-Virtual-Care\\\",\\n      \\\"is_superseded\\\": false\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"document_id\\\": \\\"b348bd9139cc5e50f7c3d94a4ddf7eee6b061486710750764d900186746c0385_full\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Virtual Care\\\",\\n      \\\"source_org\\\": \\\"cpso\\\",\\n      \\\"document_type\\\": \\\"policy\\\",\\n      \\\"effective_date\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"topics\\\": [],\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.cpso.on.ca/en/Physicians/Policies-Guidance/Policies/Virtual-Care\\\",\\n      \\\"is_superseded\\\": false\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"document_id\\\": \\\"40b976e09bb0def900a2ceac2a8d6592\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Advice to the Profession: Virtual Care\\\",\\n      \\\"source_org\\\": \\\"cpso\\\",\\n      \\\"document_type\\\": \\\"advice\\\",\\n      \\\"effective_date\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"topics\\\": [],\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.cpso.on.ca/en/Physicians/Policies-Guidance/Policies/Virtual-Care/Advice-to-the-Profession-Virtual-Care\\\",\\n      \\\"is_superseded\\\": false\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"provenance\\\": [\\n    \\\"semantic_search\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": 0.75,\\n  \\\"highlights\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"point\\\": \\\"[ORG=cpso] [TYPE=policy] [TOPIC=] **Virtual Care:** Any interaction between patients and/or members of their circle of care1 that occurs remotely2, using any form of communication or information techn...\\\",\\n      \\\"citations\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"source\\\": \\\"Unknown\\\",\\n          \\\"source_org\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n          \\\"loc\\\": \\\"Definitions\\\",\\n          \\\"page\\\": null,\\n          \\\"url\\\": null\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"policy_level\\\": null\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"point\\\": \\\"[ORG=cpso] [TYPE=advice] [TOPIC=] # Advice to the Profession: Virtual Care\\\\n\\\\n[](#)\\\\n\\\\n**Last Updated: **June 2022\\\\n\\\\n\u00a0\\\\n\\\\n*Advice to the Profession* companion documents are intended to provide physicians wit...\\\",\\n      \\\"citations\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"source\\\": \\\"Unknown\\\",\\n          \\\"source_org\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n          \\\"loc\\\": \\\"Advice to the Profession: Virtual Care\\\",\\n          \\\"page\\\": null,\\n          \\\"url\\\": null\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"policy_level\\\": null\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"point\\\": \\\"[ORG=cpso] [TYPE=advice] [TOPIC=] ***Can you elaborate on the scope of the policy? What medical services are captured by the term \u201cvirtual care\u201d?\u00a0***\\\\n\\\\nVirtual care is defined in the policy as \u201cany int...\\\",\\n      \\\"citations\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"source\\\": \\\"Unknown\\\",\\n          \\\"source_org\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n          \\\"loc\\\": \\\"Virtual Care is the Practice of Medicine\\\",\\n          \\\"page\\\": null,\\n          \\\"url\\\": null\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"policy_level\\\": null\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"conflicts\\\": [],\\n  \\\"query_interpretation\\\": \\\"Searching for: virtual care documentation\\\",\\n  \\\"citations\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"Unknown\\\",\\n      \\\"source_org\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"loc\\\": \\\"Definitions\\\",\\n      \\\"page\\\": null,\\n      \\\"url\\\": null\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"Unknown\\\",\\n      \\\"source_org\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"loc\\\": \\\"Advice to the Profession: Virtual Care\\\",\\n      \\\"page\\\": null,\\n      \\\"url\\\": null\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"Unknown\\\",\\n      \\\"source_org\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"loc\\\": \\\"Virtual Care is the Practice of Medicine\\\",\\n      \\\"page\\\": null,\\n      \\\"url\\\": null\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"Virtual Care\\\",\\n      \\\"source_org\\\": \\\"cpso\\\",\\n      \\\"loc\\\": \\\"Document ID: 20ea133f1a278acf28b4d904d73e9f79\\\",\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.cpso.on.ca/en/Physicians/Policies-Guidance/Policies/Virtual-Care\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"Advice to the Profession: Virtual Care\\\",\\n      \\\"source_org\\\": \\\"cpso\\\",\\n      \\\"loc\\\": \\\"Document ID: 04ffded4c0aab9414681ee57aee7e29023a5799be33c8c987a9b98c762a3c3a3_full\\\",\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.cpso.on.ca/en/Physicians/Policies-Guidance/Policies/Virtual-Care/Advice-to-the-Profession-Virtual-Care\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"Advice to the Profession: Virtual Care\\\",\\n      \\\"source_org\\\": \\\"cpso\\\",\\n      \\\"loc\\\": \\\"Document ID: 06bc2c515c4a3fa447e63beb93347587\\\",\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.cpso.on.ca/en/Physicians/Policies-Guidance/Policies/Virtual-Care/Advice-to-the-Profession-Virtual-Care\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"Virtual Care\\\",\\n      \\\"source_org\\\": \\\"cpso\\\",\\n      \\\"loc\\\": \\\"Document ID: b348bd9139cc5e50f7c3d94a4ddf7eee6b061486710750764d900186746c0385_full\\\",\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.cpso.on.ca/en/Physicians/Policies-Guidance/Policies/Virtual-Care\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"Advice to the Profession: Virtual Care\\\",\\n      \\\"source_org\\\": \\\"cpso\\\",\\n      \\\"loc\\\": \\\"Document ID: 40b976e09bb0def900a2ceac2a8d6592\\\",\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.cpso.on.ca/en/Physicians/Policies-Guidance/Policies/Virtual-Care/Advice-to-the-Profession-Virtual-Care\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"_tool_name\\\": \\\"opa_search_sections\\\",\\n  \\\"_citation_count\\\": 8\\n}\",\"annotations\":null,\"meta\":null}", "type": "function_call_output"}','2025-09-29 01:27:07');
INSERT INTO agent_messages VALUES(54,'26cb378e-4e35-4a04-9330-df54886868ec','{"id": "msg_68d9e06c4bcc8196a2252628c104446d01148f0c530f0049", "content": [{"annotations": [], "text": "**SUMMARY**: The CPSO outlines specific requirements for virtual care documentation. This includes clear recording of all interactions, adherence to privacy and security measures, and compliance with established best practices to ensure high-quality, safe care.\n\n**DETAILED RESPONSE**:\nThe CPSO''s policy on virtual care documentation emphasizes both the responsibility of healthcare providers to document care accurately and the importance of maintaining patient privacy. Here are the key components of the requirements:\n\n1. **Definition of Virtual Care**: The CPSO defines virtual care as any interaction between patients and/or members of their care team that occurs remotely. This includes various communication technologies such as telephone, video conferencing, and secure messaging platforms. Such documentation must encompass the purpose and details of the interaction.\n\n2. **Documentation Standards**: Physicians are expected to keep comprehensive records of virtual consultations, which should include:\n   - The patient''s clinical history relevant to the encounter.\n   - Details of the assessment and any interventions made.\n   - Information on referrals or follow-up plans.\n   - Any other details relevant to the care provided.\n\n3. **Privacy and Security**: The CPSO highlights that all documentation must comply with privacy regulations. For instance, you should follow guidelines outlined by the Information and Privacy Commissioner of Ontario, specifically related to virtual health care. This means ensuring that all communications are secure and that patient information is protected accordingly.\n\n4. **Informed Consent**: Healthcare providers are also required to obtain informed consent for virtual care, which must be documented clearly. This includes informing the patient about the nature of the virtual care, potential limitations, and how their data will be managed securely.\n\n5. **Best Practices**: Additionally, the CPSO provides guidelines that recommend adopting best practices for virtual care, including maintaining clear communication with patients regarding their care and ensuring that the technological means used are reliable and secure.\n\n**Current Guidance References**:\n- For further details on the policies governing virtual care, see [CPSO - Virtual Care Policy](https://www.cpso.on.ca/en/Physicians/Policies-Guidance/Policies/Virtual-Care).\n- Additional advice on virtual care can be found in the [Advice to the Profession: Virtual Care](https://www.cpso.on.ca/en/Physicians/Policies-Guidance/Policies/Virtual-Care/Advice-to-the-Profession-Virtual-Care).\n\n**Implementation Notes**:\n- Review and familiarize yourself with these documents to integrate the recommendations and mandates into your virtual care practices.\n- Regularly consult the CPSO\u2019s existing guidelines concerning medical records and privacy to ensure compliance.\n\n**Currency Note**: The guidance remains updated and relevant as of June 2022, maintaining high confidence in its applicability in current practice.", "type": "output_text", "logprobs": []}], "role": "assistant", "status": "completed", "type": "message"}','2025-09-29 01:27:16');
